(https://github.com/anchore/syft/pull/5111) @skyhisi]\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- Pin Gguff lib to prevent dropping packages [PR [#5447](https://github.com/anchore/syft/pull/5447) @spiffcs]\n- Licensing: copyright holder missing, needed for Debian packaging [Issue [#5394](https://github.com/anchore/syft/issues/5394)] [PR [#5414](https://github.com/anchore/syft/pull/5414) @wagoodman]\n- Syft cli.Command() panics when invoked multiple times [Issue [#2285](https://github.com/anchore/syft/issues/2285)] [PR [#5386](https://github.com/anchore/syft/pull/5386) @JasonMetal]\n\n### Additional Changes\n\n- bump go-make module and action together [PR [#5415](https://github.com/anchore/syft/pull/5415) @wagoodman]\n\n### Dependencies\n\n49 dependency changes (46 updated, 1 added, 2 removed). 5 vulnerabilities remediated.\n\n**🟢 Remediated (5)**\n\n- [GO-2026-6603](https://go.dev/cl/847185) (High) — golang.org/x/net\n- [GO-2026-6610](https://go.dev/cl/835145) (High) — golang.org/x/net\n- [GO-2026-6611](https://go.dev/cl/847186) (High) — golang.org/x/net\n- [GO-2026-6612](https://go.dev/cl/847187) (Critical) — golang.org/x/net\n- [GO-2026-6617](https://go.dev/cl/847188) (High) — golang.org/x/net\n\n<details>\n<summary>Updated (46 packages)</summary>\n\n- cloud.google.com/go/auth `v0.23.2` → `v0.23.3`\n- cloud.google.com/go/compute/metadata `v0.9.0` → `v0.9.1`\n- cloud.google.com/go/storage `v1.65.1` → `v1.68.0`\n- github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/opentelemetry-operations-go/detectors/gcp `v1.33.0` → `v1.34.0`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2 `v1.44.0` → `v1.47.1`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/config `v1.32.40` → `v1.33.6`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/credentials `v1.19.39` → `v1.20.6`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/feature/ec2/imds `v1.18.40` → `v1.20.1`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/internal/configsources `v1.4.40` → `v1.5.4`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/internal/endpoints/v2 `v2.7.40` → `v2.8.4`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/internal/v4a `v1.4.41` → `v1.5.4`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/internal/checksum `v1.10.0` → `v1.11.5`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/internal/presigned-url `v1.13.40` → `v1.14.4`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/internal/s3shared `v1.19.41` → `v1.20.4`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/s3 `v1.108.0` → `v1.114.0`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/signin `v1.6.0` → `v1.10.1`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/sso `v1.34.0` → `v1.38.1`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/ssooidc `v1.39.0` → `v1.43.1`\n- github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/sts `v1.46.0` → `v1.51.1`\n- github.com/github/go-spdx/v2 `v2.7.0` → `v2.7.1`\n- github.com/go-git/go-billy/v5 `v5.9.1` → `v5.9.2`\n- github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 `v5.19.2` → `v5.19.3`\n- github.com/google/s2a-go `v0.1.9` → `v0.1.10`\n- github.com/googleapis/enterprise-certificate-proxy `v0.3.20` → `v0.3.22`\n- github.com/googleapis/gax-go/v2 `v2.24.0` → `v2.24.1`\n- github.com/gookit/color `v1.6.1` → `v1.6.2`\n- github.com/gpustack/gguf-parser-go `v0.26.3` → `v0.26.4`\n- github.com/hashicorp/go-getter `v1.8.9` → `v1.8.10`\n- github.com/pb33f/ordered-map/v2 `v2.3.1` → `v2.3.2`\n- github.com/pjbgf/sha1cd `v0.6.0` → `v0.7.0`\n- github.com/spiffe/go-spiffe/v2 `v2.7.0` → `v2.8.1`\n- golang.org/x/crypto `v0.57.0` → `v0.58.0`\n- golang.org/x/net `v0.59.0` → `v0.61.0` **(🟢 remediated [GO-2026-6603](https://go.dev/cl/847185), [GO-2026-6610](https://go.dev/cl/835145), [GO-2026-6611](https://go.dev/cl/847186), [GO-2026-6612](https://go.dev/cl/847187), [GO-2026-6617](https://go.dev/cl/847188))**\n- golang.org/x/oauth2 `v0.36.0` → `v0.37.0`\n- golang.org/x/sync `v0.23.0` → `v0.24.0`\n- golang.org/x/sys `v0.48.0` → `v0.49.0`\n- golang.org/x/term `v0.46.0` → `v0.47.0`\n- golang.org/x/text `v0.42.0` → `v0.43.0`\n- golang.org/x/tools `v0.50.0` → `v0.51.0`\n- google.golang.org/api `v0.294.0` → `v0.299.0`\n- google.golang.org/genproto/googleapis/rpc `v0.0.0-da73d73` → `v0.0.0-b142276`\n- google.golang.org/grpc `v1.83.2` → `v1.84.0`\n- modernc.org/cc/v4 `v4.29.2` → `v4.29.7`\n- modernc.org/ccgo/v4 `v4.35.0` → `v4.36.1`\n- modernc.org/libc `v1.75.7` → `v1.77.1`\n- modernc.org/sqlite `v1.59.0` → `v1.60.1`\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Added (1 package)</summary>\n\n- github.com/pb33f/go-yaml `v0.1.0`\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Removed (2 packages)</summary>\n\n- github.com/klauspost/cpuid/v2 `v2.3.0`\n- go.yaml.in/yaml/v4 `v4.0.0-rc.2`\n</details>\n\n**[(Full Changelog)](https://github.com/anchore/syft/compare/v1.54.1...v1.55.0)**\n\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":4}
